[A.]
<h2>~kHive Cluster~.</h2>
So you picked Hive cluster.  Have fun with the MOSQUITOS.  Heeheehe.
$Button=I Want Info,Tell,Info
$Button=Don't Want Info,Tell,No

[Say]
<i>When numbers are a disadvantage to you, the enemy will swarm around you like bees.  That's the time you break out the bug spray."<br>
--The Virtuous Warrior<br>
$Button=Back,Tell,Info

[Info]
<h2>Info:</h2><br>
Ok, you each start with 25000.  All the ai's have special "money recharging" abilities in a variety of time periods.<br>
You have one ally and your against 6.<br>
